# tcsh 6.00 translation units: vendor/2.11BSD/usr/bin/tcsh, with sh.c the
# entry (manifest "main").  alloc11 is not linked: config_f.h sets SYSMALLOC,
# so tc.alloc.c defines only its Malloc/Realloc/Calloc/Free wrappers over
# libc's malloc.  tcsh_trim.c is FGX source standing in for the six TUs
# dropped for code size.
#
# Five TUs are FGX copies under src/userland/tcsh, each verbatim apart from
# making one function's large locals `static' (tcsh 133 -> 74 bank-0 stack
# pages); `tcstatic' and `tccomp' test them, and docs/PROVENANCE.md registers
# them.
